member.summary:
Gets the names of every public instance property declared in the hierarchy of ,
ordered from the topmost base class down to the most derived type (same order as
). Results are cached per .

remarks.para:
Reads and writes to the cache are thread-safe via ;
concurrent first-time generation of the same key may execute the factory more than once, but the result
is deterministic for a given type and only one instance is retained.
